{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18873","headline":"平蔡州三首 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"平蔡州三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汝南晨鸡喔喔鸣，城头鼓角音和平。\n路傍老人忆旧事，相与感激皆涕零。\n老人收泣前致辞，官军入城人不知。\n忽惊元和十二载，重见天宝承平时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}